{"wrapper": "g2p", "language": "es", "text": "El 25% de 3.000 personas"}
{"wrapper": "g2p", "language": "es", "text": "Dr. García y Sra. López"}
{"wrapper": "g2p", "language": "es", "text": "ONU, OTAN y UE"}
{"wrapper": "g2p", "language": "es", "text": "Vamos a ver si funciona el sistema con tildes: camión, árbol, pingüino."}
{"wrapper": "g2p", "language": "es", "text": "\"comillas\" y 'simples'"}
{"wrapper": "g2p", "language": "es", "text": "[corchetes] {llaves}"}
{"wrapper": "g2p", "language": "fr-fr", "text": "Bonjour, ça va ?"}
{"wrapper": "g2p", "language": "fr-fr", "text": "Il a dit : « viens ici » (vite)."}
{"wrapper": "g2p", "language": "fr-fr", "text": "L'été 1999 était « chaud »…"}
{"wrapper": "g2p", "language": "fr-fr", "text": "C'est-à-dire — enfin"}
{"wrapper": "g2p", "language": "fr-fr", "text": "Aujourd'hui, je mange une pomme."}
{"wrapper": "g2p", "language": "fr-fr", "text": "M. Dupont et Mme Martin"}
{"wrapper": "g2p", "language": "fr-fr", "text": "Le football est populaire."}
{"wrapper": "g2p", "language": "fr-fr", "text": "(entre parenthèses)"}
{"wrapper": "g2p", "language": "fr-fr", "text": "« »"}
